AW8624 userspace regression tests
================================

Run from any directory:

  python3 tools/testing/selftests/aw8624/run.py
  AW8624_TEST_REPEATS=100 python3 tools/testing/selftests/aw8624/run.py

Requires Python 3, a C compiler supporting AddressSanitizer/UBSan, Linux input
UAPI headers, and pthreads. CC selects the compiler. The runner extracts the
actual driver functions and RTP table, then compiles them with mocked kernel,
firmware, timer, input, I2C, and wakeup interfaces. It covers effect routing and
per-slot publication, gain scaling, timer cancellation, RTP fallback and
cancellation, firmware callback lifetime, suspend gating, and stale misc FDs.

These are controlled userspace tests. They do not exercise the real kernel
scheduler, I2C controller, AW8624 chip, Android firmware helper, or a phone.
